hangga't kaya mo.

590
00:30:11.769 --> 00:30:12.937
[sigaw] Pribadong Ra In-ho.

591
00:30:13.479 --> 00:30:16.231
Nasa phone ako.
Sorry, Private Lee Jae-yoon.

592
00:30:16.232 --> 00:30:17.900
Maaari mo bang patawarin ako saglit?

593
00:30:18.943 --> 00:30:21.528
Oh, oo, sige.

594
00:30:21.529 --> 00:30:22.613
Salamat po sir.

595
00:30:26.367 --> 00:30:28.077
[sumigaw] Pasensya na! [mahinahon] Uh...

596
00:30:29.787 --> 00:30:31.080
Mm-hmm. Naiintindihan ko.

597
00:30:32.373 --> 00:30:33.541
