Jae-yoon.

602
00:30:50.057 --> 00:30:51.307
Pribado, Lee Jae-yoon.

603
00:30:51.308 --> 00:30:53.601
Huh? Bumaba ang boses mo.
Ibaba mo ang iyong bantay?

604
00:30:53.602 --> 00:30:55.104
