Sinabi namin na walang mga telepono, hindi ba?

638
00:32:22.024 --> 00:32:24.567
Hmm. I guess it was on. Huh. Ang masama ko.

639
00:32:24.568 --> 00:32:27.445
Si Jae-yoon iyon.

640
00:32:27.446 --> 00:32:29.322
[Tae-shik] Huh. Hindi pwede.

641
00:32:29.323 --> 00:32:30.698
[Jin-wook] Siya ba ito?

642
00:32:30.699 --> 00:32:32.367
Kaya sinasabi mo... [chuckles]

643
00:32:32.368 --> 00:32:34.160
- Oo.
- Saan mo dinala ito?

644
00:32:34.161 --> 00:32:35.912
Eden Hotel yun diba?

645
00:32:35.913 --> 00:32:38.247
Kinuha ko ito kahapon
pagkatapos lang ng tanghalian.

646
00:32:38.248 --> 00:32:40.083
- Talaga?
- Dalawang sundalo na may delivery bag,

647
00:32:40.084 --> 00:32:41.167
lahat nakakatawa.

648
00:32:41.168 --> 00:32:43.002
Boyfriend mo ba ang isa sa kanila?

649
00:32:43.003 --> 00:32:45.046
- At masasabi mo lang mula doon?
- Oo.

650
00:32:45.047 --> 00:32:47.256
Walang paraan na masasabi mo.
Walang magagawa.

651
00:32:47.257 --> 00:32:48.217
[Bumuntong hininga si Young-joo]

652
00:32:50.636 --> 00:32:51.762
Jae-yoon.

653
00:32:53.222 --> 00:32:54.056
[hikbi]

654
00:32:59.269 --> 00:33:00.269
Si Jae-yoon, ang gumagala sa ibang bansa
hindi gumagana ng maayos dito,

655
00:33:00.270 --> 00:33:01.771
kaya hindi ako makalusot.
Okay naman kami, kaya huwag kang mag-alala.

656
00:33:01.772 --> 00:33:02.980
Mapayapa pa rin ang Africa
nang walang nangyayari.

657
00:33:02.981 --> 00:33:03.940
Kamusta naman dyan?

658
00:33:03.941 --> 00:33:05.692
Hindi maganda ang mga bagay dito, Inay.

659
00:33:05.693 --> 00:33:07.568
Kung ang mga bagay ay nagiging kakaiba din sa Africa,
hindi ka dapat umalis sa hotel.

660
00:33:07.569 --> 00:33:08.861
{\an8}Nasa panganib ka, anak.
Huwag lumabas ng unit.

661
00:33:08.862 --> 00:33:10.947
{\an8}Gusto ni Itay na manatili ka sa unit
hanggang sa tumahimik na ang mga pangyayari.

662
00:33:10.948 --> 00:33:12.491
{\an8}Okay, Nanay. Huwag kang mag-alala.

663
00:33:17.955 --> 00:33:18.997
[bumuntong hininga]

664
00:33:26.004 --> 00:33:26.964
[Buntong hininga ang binata]

665
00:33:30.634 --> 00:33:32.636
[nagpapatugtog ng kakaibang musika]

666
00:33:34.722 --> 00:33:36.223
[Sung-wook sniffles]

667
00:33:38.308 --> 00:33:39.893
Nakausap mo ba ang lola mo?

668
00:33:40.102 --> 00:33:41.853
[Young-man] Hindi siya sumasagot.

669
00:33:41.854 --> 00:33:45.858
[exhales] Huwag masyadong mag-alala tungkol dito.
Sigurado akong ayos lang siya.

670
00:33:47.818 --> 00:33:48.985
Nasa Busan ka, ha?

671
00:33:48.986 --> 00:33:51.028
- Nakatira ako sa Gaepo-dong.
- Sabihin mo ulit?

672
00:33:51.029 --> 00:33:52.823
Gaepo-dong... hindi Busan.

673
00:33:54.074 --> 00:33:55.658
Mukha ka lang taga Busan.

674
00:33:55.659 --> 00:33:57.286
hindi ako. Anong ibig mong sabihin?

675
00:33:58.704 --> 00:34:01.248
[Ginagaya ang Young-man] Ano ang ibig mong sabihin,
"anong ibig mong sabihin", Sir?

676
00:34:01.623 --> 00:34:03.625
[nagpapatugtog ng kakaibang musika]

677
00:34:05.627 --> 00:34:07.337
Kaya aling paraan ito, kung gayon?

678
00:34:10.132 --> 00:34:11.340
[Young-man] Sa ganoong paraan.

679
00:34:11.341 --> 00:34:13.093
[Tae-hwa] Hindi. Gaepo-dong ay ganoon.

680
00:34:20.267 --> 00:34:22.478
Sa tingin ko oras na para tapusin mo
iyong daydream.

681
00:34:24.104 --> 00:34:25.606
Oo, sir. tama ka.

682
00:34:26.690 --> 00:34:27.941
Pupunta ako sa barracks ngayon.

683
00:34:35.741 --> 00:34:38.201
- [Bumuntong hininga si Tae-hwa]
- [Nilinis ni Sung-wook ang lalamunan]

684
00:34:38.202 --> 00:34:41.789
Gusto kong itanong...
nagkaroon ka ba ng pagkakataon na tawagan ang iyong asawa?

685
00:34:42.498 --> 00:34:46.751
Hindi, hindi ko ginawa. Hindi.
[huminga ng malalim] Hindi sa mahabang panahon.

686
00:34:46.752 --> 00:34:48.670
[pag-click sa dila]
Siya ay mas katulad ng isang dating asawa.

687
00:34:49.463 --> 00:34:51.256
[Tae-hwa clicks tongue] Wow, ang hirap.

688
00:34:51.465 --> 00:34:52.591
Pero, eh...

689
00:34:56.303 --> 00:34:58.262
Kailangan mong siguraduhin
tawagan mo mga kababayan mo...

690
00:34:58.263 --> 00:34:59.847
ang kanilang kaligtasan ay mahalaga.

691
00:34:59.848 --> 00:35:02.559
[huminga ng malalim] Oo.

692
00:35:04.353 --> 00:35:07.105
Nakakuha ng ilang mga usok, kung nagkataon?

693
00:35:08.315 --> 00:35:09.233
out na ako lahat.

694
00:35:13.904 --> 00:35:16.448
Dapat may kumuha
ang sigarilyo ko nang ibinaba ko ito...

695
00:35:19.076 --> 00:35:21.703
[sniffles] Magiging okay lang ba?

696
00:35:22.704 --> 00:35:26.123
[Tae-shik] Huwag kang mag-alala.
Sa mga panahong ito, mas ligtas ka bilang isang sundalo.

697
00:35:26.124 --> 00:35:28.877
- [Jin-wook] Oo, mas ligtas ang mga sundalo.
- Nag-aalala ako sa atin.

698
00:35:35.008 --> 00:35:36.676
[Tae-shik] Binuksan mo ang iyong telepono?

699
00:35:36.677 --> 00:35:37.635
{\an8}[Jin-wook] Ikaw ba?

700
00:35:37.636 --> 00:35:39.762
{\an8}JAE-YOON - NGAYON

701
00:35:39.763 --> 00:35:42.098
[huminga ng malalim] Jae-yoon.

702
00:35:42.099 --> 00:35:44.392
- Nakipag-ugnayan ka?
- Nakipag-ugnayan ka ba?

703
00:35:44.393 --> 00:35:45.935
[Jae-yoon] <i>Young-joo okay ka lang?</i>

704
00:35:45.936 --> 00:35:47.854
<i>Okay ka lang, tama ba? Okay lang ako.</i>

705
00:35:47.855 --> 00:35:50.607
<i>Huwag mong sabihin sa akin na sinusubukan mo
upang pumunta at hanapin ako.</i>

706
00:35:52.943 --> 00:35:55.027
<i>Magtago sa isang ligtas na lugar, okay?</i>

707
00:35:55.028 --> 00:35:57.781
<i>Sabihin mo lang kung nasaan ka
at pupunta ako at hahanapin ka.</i>

708
00:35:58.448 --> 00:35:59.741
Sabi niya okay lang siya.

709
00:36:00.659 --> 00:36:02.369
Ano ang sinabi ko? Subukang huwag mag-alala.

710
00:36:02.995 --> 00:36:04.329
- Salamat sa Diyos.
- Salamat sa Diyos.

711
00:36:05.372 --> 00:36:06.205
CALLING... JAE-YOON

712
00:36:06.206 --> 00:36:08.625
- [Tae-shik] Bakit ka nangongopya?
- [Jin-wook] Hindi ko ginawa.

713
00:36:09.376 --> 00:36:11.377
[Young-joo suminghot, humihikbi]

714
00:36:11.378 --> 00:36:12.962
[line ring]

715
00:36:12.963 --> 00:36:16.173
[voicemail] <i>Ang taong sinusubukan mo
upang maabot ay kasalukuyang hindi magagamit.</i>

716
00:36:16.174 --> 00:36:18.719
<i>Kapag narinig mo ang beep,
mangyaring iwanan ang iyong mensahe.</i>

717
00:36:19.511 --> 00:36:20.345
[natapos ang tawag]

718
00:36:22.723 --> 00:36:26.602
Dahil sa mataas na volume,
hindi natuloy.

719
00:36:27.185 --> 00:36:29.937
Huwag kang mag-alala tungkol dito.
Maghintay lang ng kaunti, ito ay gagana.

720
00:36:29.938 --> 00:36:31.439
Oo, maghintay. Ito ay gagana.

721
00:36:31.440 --> 00:36:33.357
[Tae-shik] Alam mo ginagawa mo na naman.

722
00:36:33.358 --> 00:36:34.609
[Jin-wook] Ha?

723
00:36:34.610 --> 00:36:36.777
Sa tingin ko kailangan kong pumunta sa A tower ngayon.

724
00:36:36.778 --> 00:36:38.655
Hindi. Ano? Nakakabaliw iyon.

725
00:36:39.114 --> 00:36:40.698
I mean, tumingin ka sa bintana. Halika na!

726
00:36:40.699 --> 00:36:44.202
Pinahahalagahan ko ang lahat ng iyong tulong, Jin-wook.
I swear hindi kita makakalimutan.

727
00:36:44.828 --> 00:36:46.914
Alex, salamat
mula sa kaibuturan ng aking puso.

728
00:36:47.664 --> 00:36:48.624
pupunta ako ngayon.

729
00:36:49.333 --> 00:36:52.294
- Ano? Hay... Teka!
- Young-joo, uy!

730
00:36:53.295 --> 00:36:54.212
Pupunta rin ako.

731
00:36:57.299 --> 00:36:59.717
- [Young-joo] Bakit?
- Dapat tayong pumunta nang magkasama,

732
00:36:59.718 --> 00:37:03.555
dahil pupunta ako sa hotel,
dahil doon ko naiwan ang sasakyan ko.

733
00:37:04.556 --> 00:37:07.059
At ang dalawa ay mas mahusay kaysa sa isa.
O mas mabuti kaysa--

734
00:37:09.394 --> 00:37:10.228
[bumuntong hininga]

735
00:37:11.104 --> 00:37:12.064
At ano naman sayo?

736
00:37:15.108 --> 00:37:15.943
Oh...

737
00:37:17.527 --> 00:37:18.403
Anak ng aso.

738
00:37:19.154 --> 00:37:20.613
Yan lang ang ramyun natin?

739
00:37:20.614 --> 00:37:23.366
tama yan.
Kagabi ang mga private sa night shift

740
00:37:23.367 --> 00:37:25.451
kumain ng lahat para sa midnight snack.

741
00:37:25.452 --> 00:37:26.953
[Tae-hwa] Gaano ito katagal?

742
00:37:26.954 --> 00:37:28.413
Sa susunod na dalawang araw.

743
00:37:29.081 --> 00:37:31.124
[sabay buntong hininga ang lahat]

744
00:37:31.917 --> 00:37:34.127
Kaya, ano ito?

745
00:37:35.212 --> 00:37:36.755
Iyon ay rasyon ng digmaan.

746
00:37:37.339 --> 00:37:38.674
[Soo-jeong] Ah!

747
00:37:41.009 --> 00:37:43.678
- Mukhang masama iyon.
- Hindi lang masama. Ito ang pinakamasama.

748
00:37:43.679 --> 00:37:45.013
Bago tayo kumain...

749
00:37:46.765 --> 00:37:48.350
May announcement akong gagawin.

750
00:37:48.809 --> 00:37:51.353
- Nauubusan na tayo ng pagkain.
- [kaluskos ng kuryente]

751
00:37:51.937 --> 00:37:53.397
[bumubulalas lahat]

752
00:37:53.939 --> 00:37:55.941
[Sung-wook] Napatay ba nila ang grid?

753
00:37:56.942 --> 00:37:57.859
[Jae-yoon] Anong bata?

754
00:37:58.735 --> 00:37:59.860
[Soo-jeong] Anong bata?

755
00:37:59.861 --> 00:38:01.153
[Sung-wook] Ang grid.

756
00:38:01.154 --> 00:38:02.322
[Jae-yoon] Oh, ang grid...

757
00:38:03.573 --> 00:38:04.448
[hinihingal]

758
00:38:04.449 --> 00:38:07.034
Namumula ka ba sa ilong mo
sa mesa, ikaw ay maliit na tae?

759
00:38:07.035 --> 00:38:08.911
Pribadong Ra In-ho. I'm so sorry.

760
00:38:08.912 --> 00:38:10.872
[Jae-yoon] Dude. Ugh!

761
00:38:11.456 --> 00:38:12.874
- Ay, hoy!
- Ikaw... Hindi mo kaya--

762
00:38:13.500 --> 00:38:14.875
Anong ginagawa mo dude?

763
00:38:14.876 --> 00:38:15.794
[Napabuntong-hininga si In-ho]

764
00:38:17.963 --> 00:38:19.755
{\an8}[Tae-hwa] Meron kami
dalawang araw na pagkain...

765
00:38:19.756 --> 00:38:21.757
{\an8}- [Napabuntong-hininga si In-ho]
- ...kung kumain tayo ng mga normal na bahagi.

766
00:38:21.758 --> 00:38:24.760
Kailangan kong maunawaan mo
na kailangan nating kumain ng matipid...

767
00:38:24.761 --> 00:38:27.013
- Ngayon, hindi na namin matawagan ang sinuman.
- [Jae-yoon] Ha?

768
00:38:27.014 --> 00:38:29.265
[Tae-hwa] ...ang timeline
dahil ang muling supply ay--

769
00:38:29.266 --> 00:38:32.727
- Ah! Seryoso ka ba?
- Sa tingin ko ay mawawalan na naman tayo ng kapangyarihan.

770
00:38:32.728 --> 00:38:35.354
Akala mo isang gusali na ganito ang laki
gagamit ng ATS?

771
00:38:35.355 --> 00:38:36.397
Manahimik ka.

772
00:38:36.398 --> 00:38:39.608
Kadalasan may ATS
sa pagitan ng panlabas na grid at generator.

773
00:38:39.609 --> 00:38:41.903
- [Tae-hwa] Sino ang nagsasalita?
- [parehong] Sir, sorry.

774
00:38:43.405 --> 00:38:44.406
Gaya nga ng sinabi ko...

775
00:38:46.241 --> 00:38:48.452
Tayo, kahit gaano kahirap,
ibahagi ang pasanin na ito...

776
00:38:49.619 --> 00:38:50.954
at panatilihin ang ating lakas.

777
00:38:51.580 --> 00:38:52.831
Alam kong hindi ito gaanong...

778
00:38:54.249 --> 00:38:55.416
ngunit ito lang ang mayroon tayo.

779
00:38:55.417 --> 00:38:56.375
[Buntong hininga ang binata]

780
00:38:56.376 --> 00:38:57.668
Masarap ako sa isang cup noodle.

781
00:38:57.669 --> 00:38:59.421
Ilang cup noodles,

782
00:39:01.173 --> 00:39:02.132
yun lang...

783
00:39:04.176 --> 00:39:06.177
At kasama ang mga batang ito na nahihirapan...

784
00:39:06.178 --> 00:39:09.639
nakikita silang kumakain ng kanin
walang sabaw,

785
00:39:10.974 --> 00:39:12.934
medyo nadudurog ang puso ko.

786
00:39:14.853 --> 00:39:16.645
- Gye-young.
- Corporal Kwak Gye-young.

787
00:39:16.646 --> 00:39:17.563
Magpakulo ng tubig.

788
00:39:17.564 --> 00:39:20.859
Oo, sir. Ako sa ito.
Hoy ang galing mo kumain ka na.

789
00:39:24.488 --> 00:39:26.447
- Babalik ako.
- [Tae-hwa] Kain na tayo.

790
00:39:26.448 --> 00:39:28.324
[lahat] Masarap kumain.

791
00:39:28.325 --> 00:39:29.493
Masarap kumain.

792
00:39:31.495 --> 00:39:33.872
- Hyung-bae, kumain na tayo.
- Sir, pasensya na.

793
00:39:37.501 --> 00:39:39.503
[hindi malinaw na pag-ungol]

794
00:39:40.504 --> 00:39:41.712
[Young-joo humihingal]

795
00:39:41.713 --> 00:39:43.799
- [Jin-wook] Whoa, whoa.
- [Tae-shik] Ano?

796
00:39:44.800 --> 00:39:46.509
[Huminga ng malalim si Young-joo]

797
00:39:46.510 --> 00:39:48.511
- Doon mismo.
- [Young-joo] Saan tayo pupunta?

798
00:39:48.512 --> 00:39:50.514
[Jin-wook] Tara na. Halika, halika.

799
00:39:51.348 --> 00:39:52.849
[pagsusumigaw]

800
00:39:56.061 --> 00:39:58.604
- [Humihingal si Young-joo]
- [Jin-wook] Ay, naku.

801
00:39:58.605 --> 00:39:59.688
Sa ganitong paraan, sa ganitong paraan.

802
00:39:59.689 --> 00:40:01.066
Go, go.

803
00:40:07.405 --> 00:40:09.240
[Jin-wook] Mabilis, mabilis. Mag-ingat ka.

804
00:40:09.241 --> 00:40:11.201
- [humirit]
- [nakanguso]

805
00:40:21.419 --> 00:40:24.881
- Ang tamang paraan upang makapunta sa A tower?
- Oo, ngunit mukhang ito.

806
00:40:25.632 --> 00:40:27.092
Napatay mo ba ang iyong mga telepono?

807
00:40:27.843 --> 00:40:29.552
Inilagay ko ito sa tahimik. Magaling kami.

808
00:40:29.553 --> 00:40:31.053
Sabi mo isara mo sila!

809
00:40:31.054 --> 00:40:34.474
- [sighs] Jin-wook. Magpatuloy lang tayo.
- [Jin-wook] Kailangan nating--

810
00:40:35.600 --> 00:40:37.185
Galit ka pa nawala sayo?

811
00:40:37.894 --> 00:40:39.896
[malayong pag-ungol]

812
00:40:40.772 --> 00:40:42.232
- [Jin-wook] Ooh.
- [hinihingal]

813
00:40:46.653 --> 00:40:47.654
[ungol]

814
00:40:48.488 --> 00:40:51.283
[Jin-wook] Damn. Napaka-clumsy mo.

815
00:40:51.867 --> 00:40:53.702
- Ayos ka lang ba?
- Oo. Oo, ayos lang ako.

816
00:40:53.952 --> 00:40:55.370
Parehong hindi nakatali ang sapatos mo.

817
00:40:57.622 --> 00:40:59.624
[nagpapatugtog ng melancholy music]

818
00:41:02.043 --> 00:41:03.044
[Ngumuso si Young-joo]

819
00:41:07.883 --> 00:41:09.384
[Jae-yoon] Una, ganito...

820
00:41:10.677 --> 00:41:12.596
<i>- At pagkatapos ay sa ilalim...</i>
- [Humihikbi si Young-joo]

821
00:41:13.346 --> 00:41:14.389
[Jae-yoon] <i>Ganito.</i>

822
00:41:22.647 --> 00:41:23.815
Diyos.

823
00:41:26.234 --> 00:41:27.194
[Dumigmig si Hyung-bae]

824
00:41:28.361 --> 00:41:29.237
[Tae-hwa] Huh?

825
00:41:29.988 --> 00:41:31.198
I swear to God...

826
00:41:32.115 --> 00:41:33.825
[sighs] Uh.

827
00:41:34.117 --> 00:41:34.951
[Binata] Hmm?

828
00:41:36.369 --> 00:41:37.370
[pinilit na pagsubo]

829
00:41:38.371 --> 00:41:40.373
- May problema tayo.
- Ano ito?

830
00:41:40.916 --> 00:41:43.000
Nakagat si Choi Chul-woo, agad na namatay,

831
00:41:43.001 --> 00:41:44.960
pero hindi namin siya nakitang naging zombie.

832
00:41:44.961 --> 00:41:47.214
- Okay.
- Totoo yan.

833
00:41:48.006 --> 00:41:49.883
Ngunit pagkatapos, kasama si Chef Jung...

834
00:41:50.592 --> 00:41:52.135
Agad siyang lumingon.

835
00:41:52.886 --> 00:41:54.387
- [kumakatok sa pinto]
- [lahat hinihingal]

836
00:41:55.805 --> 00:41:58.391
- [patuloy ang banging]
- [Napabuntong hininga si In-ho]

837
00:42:00.143 --> 00:42:01.186
[bumubulalas lahat]

838
00:42:02.437 --> 00:42:04.356
- [patuloy ang banging]
- [In-ho] Ay, shit.

839
00:42:07.150 --> 00:42:09.693
- Sinuri mo ba ang lahat ng mga pinto?
- Siyempre, ginoo.

840
00:42:09.694 --> 00:42:11.238
Sinuri ko ang bawat huling isa sa aking sarili.

841
00:42:13.323 --> 00:42:15.158
[Nagbubulungan sina In-ho at Soo-jeong]

842
00:42:16.952 --> 00:42:18.078
[pagpasipol ng pressure cooker]

843
00:42:18.995 --> 00:42:21.997
[hinihingal] Paano kung hindi sila magbago
tama kapag nakagat sila?

844
00:42:21.998 --> 00:42:23.166
Diyos ko.

845
00:42:25.794 --> 00:42:27.045
[patuloy ang banging]

846
00:42:30.590 --> 00:42:31.423
[ungol]

847
00:42:31.424 --> 00:42:33.050
[Napabuntong-hininga si Soo-jeong]

848
00:42:33.051 --> 00:42:34.344
[Chul-woo snarling]

849
00:42:35.470 --> 00:42:37.179
- [Hyung-bae] Choi--
- [Binata] Huh?

850
00:42:37.180 --> 00:42:38.889
[Tae-hwa] Ch-- Choi Chul-woo?

851
00:42:38.890 --> 00:42:41.267
- [tumawa] Chul-woo!
- Huwag kang lumabas diyan.

852
00:42:41.268 --> 00:42:43.978
- [Hyung-bae] Chul-woo.
- [Soo-jeong] Huwag kang pumunta. Isara ang pinto.

853
00:42:43.979 --> 00:42:44.938
Hey.

854
00:42:46.356 --> 00:42:48.233
- [nakanguso]
- [Hyung-bae] Chul-woo.

855
00:42:48.817 --> 00:42:51.236
- [ungol]
- [nakanguso]

856
00:42:54.739 --> 00:42:55.949
[Hyung-bae na umuungol]

857
00:42:58.201 --> 00:43:00.160
[ungol]

858
00:43:00.161 --> 00:43:01.913
[sumisigaw]

859
00:43:10.839 --> 00:43:13.465
- [Gye-young] May kumuha sa kanya.
- [Young-man] Teka.

860
00:43:13.466 --> 00:43:14.968
[Gye-young whimpers]

861
00:43:15.552 --> 00:43:17.387
- [Chul-woo snarls]
- [sigaw ng lahat]

862
00:43:21.308 --> 00:43:23.517
- [Hyung-bae] Chul-woo.
- [Gye-young] Hyung-bae

863
00:43:23.518 --> 00:43:27.146
Sorry kung natanong kita
para gawin ang guillotine choke.

864
00:43:27.147 --> 00:43:28.939
- Hyung-bae!
- [Chul-woo snarls]

865
00:43:28.940 --> 00:43:29.858
Hyung-bae.

866
00:43:32.819 --> 00:43:34.778
- [Gye-young] Nakuha ka namin.
- [Jae-yoon] Ay!

867
00:43:34.779 --> 00:43:36.448
[Ngumisi si Tae-hwa]

868
00:43:37.240 --> 00:43:38.615
Dalhan mo ako ng isang riple at isang kumot.

869
00:43:38.616 --> 00:43:39.909
Pribadong Hwang Kyung-sik!

870
00:43:40.452 --> 00:43:42.161
[Gye-young] Corporal Jeon Hyung-bae!

871
00:43:42.162 --> 00:43:43.787
Hyung-bae, okay ka lang?

872
00:43:43.788 --> 00:43:45.164
Mapapatay ka.

873
00:43:45.165 --> 00:43:46.374
Nakakuha ako ng ideya.

874
00:43:52.505 --> 00:43:53.923
Oo, oo.

875
00:43:54.632 --> 00:43:57.051
Halika, dali! Bilisan mo!

876
00:43:57.052 --> 00:43:58.053
[Gye-young] Tulungan mo ako!

877
00:43:58.553 --> 00:43:59.887
[sumisigaw]

878
00:43:59.888 --> 00:44:01.055
papasok na ako.

879
00:44:01.056 --> 00:44:03.141
[Umiiyak si Tae-hwa]

880
00:44:04.434 --> 00:44:06.144
[ngumisi si Jae-yoon]

881
00:44:07.187 --> 00:44:08.270
[ngumisi si Chul-woo]

882
00:44:08.271 --> 00:44:10.522
kasama mo pa ba ako? Hyung-bae?

883
00:44:10.523 --> 00:44:11.858
- Hyung-bae.
- Hindi siya--

884
00:44:15.487 --> 00:44:17.613
Magpapa-CPR ako.
Mangyaring i-secure ang daanan ng hangin.

885
00:44:17.614 --> 00:44:20.407
- Anong ginagawa mo?
- Ano ako-- Ito ay CPR!

886
00:44:20.408 --> 00:44:22.452
Ugh, dapat alam mo ang kalokohang ito.

887
00:44:23.119 --> 00:44:26.038
Hindi siya pwedeng mamatay sa ganitong paraan.
Tapos magiging zombie siya.

888
00:44:26.039 --> 00:44:27.123
[Gye-young] Okay.

889
00:44:28.375 --> 00:44:31.877
Isa, dalawa, tatlo, apat
lima, anim, pito, walo...

890
00:44:31.878 --> 00:44:32.961
siyam, sampu.

891
00:44:32.962 --> 00:44:35.714
Isa, dalawa, tatlo, apat lima, anim--

892
00:44:35.715 --> 00:44:36.965
- Teka.
-Kaya mo--

893
00:44:36.966 --> 00:44:38.384
Hindi, ang ulo niya!

894
00:44:38.385 --> 00:44:41.095
- Ay, shit.
- Oh. Dalhan mo kami ng tuwalya.

895
00:44:41.096 --> 00:44:42.304
ano? Gusto mo--

896
00:44:42.305 --> 00:44:44.765
- [Soo-jeong] Please, just--
- [In-ho] Okay.

897
00:44:44.766 --> 00:44:46.475
[Jae-yoon] Ah! Papatayin niya ako.

898
00:44:46.476 --> 00:44:47.393
[In-ho ungol]

899
00:44:47.394 --> 00:44:49.186
[Jae-yoon] ...patayin mo ako. Oh, Diyos.

900
00:44:49.187 --> 00:44:51.314
- [In-ho sumigaw]
- [Jae-yoon] Kunin mo, kunin mo.

901
00:44:53.441 --> 00:44:55.317
- [mga rifle cocks]
- Ngayon, bumalik ka!

902
00:44:55.318 --> 00:44:57.653
- Binata, handa ka na ba?
- Oo, ginoo. handa na ako.

903
00:44:57.654 --> 00:45:00.198
- Sunog!
- [In-ho whimpers]

904
00:45:01.699 --> 00:45:02.950
[Chul-woo thuds]

905
00:45:02.951 --> 00:45:05.828
[In-ho humihingal]

906
00:45:05.829 --> 00:45:08.288
- [Chul-woo snarls]
- [In-ho shout, yelps]

907
00:45:08.289 --> 00:45:11.542
- Ay, shit. Anong gagawin natin?
- Kailangan mong barilin siya sa ulo.

908
00:45:11.543 --> 00:45:13.043
- Buksan ang apoy!
- [Napabuntong hininga si In-ho]

909
00:45:13.044 --> 00:45:14.671
[kumalabog ang shell casing sa sahig]

910
00:45:15.380 --> 00:45:17.382
[seryosong tumutugtog ng musika]

911
00:46:21.696 --> 00:46:23.698
[nagpapatugtog ng kakaibang musika]

912
00:47:51.244 --> 00:47:53.246
[Nagpapatugtog ng musikang marching band]

913
00:49:06.861 --> 00:49:08.905
[nagpapatugtog ng magulong musika]

914
00:50:13.469 --> 00:50:15.471
[nawala ang musika]

